      {
        "id": 200807,
        "name": "tedv",
        "username": "tedv",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/f08c70/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-30T14:31:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Your two basic options are always more card plays, less energy, or more energy, less card plays. Generally speaking, more card plays focuses on minor powers and triggering innates, while more energy focuses on major powers. Since your innate isn't that great against England, and some of your unique powers are lackluster as well, focus on your energy track and convert your less useful uniques to major powers. The 1-&gt;3 energy bump is particularly strong here.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:29:10.924Z",
