        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-30T23:07:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Flicker is a really good support, great for stalling bad sjtuations others can't reach early, or throwing a little needed help another spirit's way.</p><p>I don't find it well suited to solo play, nor is it well set up to dominate the invaders even late. &nbsp;Going against England at higher levels solo isn't going to be easy.</p>",
